    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.mp4?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2> Life in exile was empty until founding The Spare Talons. Now there's not a day without a job. Join the Captain in his quest for revenge as he recruits his crew, outfits their ships, and takes down a rotten regime while collecting a paycheck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2>In Kamikaze Tactics you will:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.mp4?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Devise unique strategies to outmaneuver your opponents.</h2>Compose your squadron from a variety of pilots and units, all with unique abilities, strengths, and weaknesses.<br>Once in battle, plan your movements while thinking turns ahead to maintain a positional advantage and outflank your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.mp4?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shields beat missiles. Armor beats kinetics. Energy weapons split the difference.</h2>Combat doesn't end with good positioning. Your weaponry matters too.<br>With a variety of weapons systems at your disposal, you will find yourself making decisions to apply the best tools to the job.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.mp4?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world fights back.</h2>Arenas come with modifiers from artillery fire to signal jamming which will force you to alter your gameplay and test your mastery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/69a22ccc5887a4977b3660b4296bf542.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/69a22ccc5887a4977b3660b4296bf542.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each run is unique.</h2>You will meet different crew members, fight different bosses, and discover more character interactions with every playthrough.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/c7f975018ff5610012cbf40d853b0d77.mp4?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2> Life in exile was empty until founding The Spare Talons. Now there's not a day without a job. Join the Captain in his quest for revenge as he recruits his crew, outfits their ships, and takes down a rotten regime while collecting a paycheck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2>In Kamikaze Tactics you will:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/97265fb64fc13999f81855bd20c3182f.mp4?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Devise unique strategies to outmaneuver your opponents.</h2>Compose your squadron from a variety of pilots and units, all with unique abilities, strengths, and weaknesses.<br>Once in battle, plan your movements while thinking turns ahead to maintain a positional advantage and outflank your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/059390250b7f804f447f1e9d89ac2e5b.mp4?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shields beat missiles. Armor beats kinetics. Energy weapons split the difference.</h2>Combat doesn't end with good positioning. Your weaponry matters too.<br>With a variety of weapons systems at your disposal, you will find yourself making decisions to apply the best tools to the job.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/4d6986552ab821a19db13a42295ceebc.mp4?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world fights back.</h2>Arenas come with modifiers from artillery fire to signal jamming which will force you to alter your gameplay and test your mastery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/69a22ccc5887a4977b3660b4296bf542.poster.avif?t=1739918558\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045260/extras/69a22ccc5887a4977b3660b4296bf542.webm?t=1739918558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each run is unique.</h2>You will meet different crew members, fight different bosses, and discover more character interactions with every playthrough.",
